            <h2 data-anchor="true" id="[long]"><br/></h2><h2 data-anchor="true" id="[long]">2026 Outdoor&nbsp;3D Schedule</h2><p data-anchor="true" id="[long]" class="o_default_snippet_text"><br/></p><blockquote><p dir="auto"><span class="h4-fs">Outdoor&nbsp;3D, Registration is 8am-12pm, course to be completed by 2pm, Age pricing: $15 for 18 and older, 13-17 $10, under 12 is free. See our facebook page for more event information. Kitchen open 7:30-2pm (or when last group leaves)</span></p><p dir="auto"><span class="h4-fs">New This year is for the 4/26, 5/24,6/28,7/26,8/23 events if you paticipate in them you will get a raffle ticket for a chance to win an ELITE Hunt3r bow of your choice in color, weight, and left/right hand. Bow hunter special does not qualify for the raffle.</span></p><p dir="auto"><span class="h4-fs">4/26/26 Fun shoot</span></p><p dir="auto"><span class="h4-fs">5/24/26 Fun shoot <font style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);">CANCLED DUE TO WEATHER</font></span></p><p dir="auto"><span class="h4-fs">6/28/26 Fun shoot</span></p><p dir="auto"><span class="h4-fs">7/26/26 Fun shoot</span></p><p dir="auto"><span class="h4-fs">8/23/26 Fun shoot</span></p><p dir="auto"><span class="h4-fs">8/30/26 Bow Hunter Special</span></p></blockquote><p id="[long]" data-anchor="true"><span class="h5-fs"><br/><br/></span></p></div></section><section class="s_text_block pt40 pb40 o_colored_level" data-snippet="s_text_block" data-name="Text">
