            <h2 data-anchor="true" id="[long]">IBO Qualifier &amp; Delaware State 3D Championship</h2>
                            <h4>May 30th and 31st 2026</h4><p><br/></p>
                            <p>Set up by Bill Sterling</p><p><span class="h4-fs"><strong>How to join:</strong></span><br/></p><p><span class="h5-fs">Registration 8:00AM-2:00PM&nbsp;</span></p><p><span class="h5-fs">Entry fees- $35 per Adult &amp; $25 per youth&nbsp;</span></p><p><span class="h4-fs"><strong>Prizes:</strong></span></p><p><span class="h5-fs">Money Payout for Adult Classes
Trophies for Youth Classes&nbsp;</span></p><p><span class="h4-fs"><strong>More event info:</strong></span></p><p><span class="h5-fs">Breakfast &amp; Lunch will be available&nbsp;</span></p><p id="[long]" data-anchor="true"><span class="h5-fs">Contact Bill Sterling with any questions wsterling48@yahoo.com</span></p><div data-name="Accordion" class="s_accordion">
        <div id="myCollapse" class=" accordion">
            <div class="accordion-item position-relative z-1" data-name="Accordion Item">
                <button type="button" class="accordion-header accordion-button justify-content-between gap-2 bg-transparent h6-fs fw-bold text-decoration-none text-reset transition-none collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" aria-expanded="false" id="accordion-button710215_1" data-bs-target="#myCollapseTab710215_1" aria-controls="myCollapseTab710215_1"><span class="flex-grow-1"><span class="h5-fs">IBO Qualifier 2026 Results:</span></span></button>
